OL,3,GNEWSAPolice work-from-home 'spoofing'
OL,4,Ainvestigation launched
OL,5,
OL,6,FSingleton said the
OL,7,F"activity/productivity spoofing" can
OL,8,Finclude taking steps to make users
OL,9,Fappears active when they are away from
OL,10,Ftheir laptops.
